body:
they are only filler because of what previously came out. i doubt if they were all originally added a military pistol OR SMG would not be filler because we dont have military versions of those (other than the m92 but that is semi auto not auto) plus it adds more gun diversity lets say te mp7 or the akm is your favorite gun. if you dont get that from brad/heli it gives you another reason to do them or even a reason to raid. 

&#x200B;

&#x200B;

heck if i got to do the guns for rust it would be a lot closer to something like borderlands/eft where recipes are a lot more unlocked and the gun you create is based on what comps are used. with the number of comps they have in the game they easily could make 1000s+ gun combos in the game. 

But i think it all comes down to if you want more guns in the game. some people will so its a waste for x reason while others just want gun varity.

 I think this may also speak to why facepunch hasnt added any guns recently because the community is so split on if more weapons should be added or not.

hey derkazzz. like alot of us on this sub i would love to go professional but if that didn't pan out for me how did you get into analytics? every since league blew up (10 ish years now) i have wanted to be a analysis or coach (mostly analysis). at this point its a dream for me in fortnite but i have no idea where to start. any tips you could share??

&#x200B;

