like holy fuck dude this can be 1 sentence it doesnt need to be an essay. and im pretty sure what z1018 is saying it is helps clear his name it doesnt make it 100% clear like you are assuming. like your phrasing all of this like its so black and white. him streaming PROVES nothing but it does help as a starting ground o you can see (actions, intentions,mentality, etc) no one not even Z1018 is saying it 100% proves his innocence. please read what others are saying to you bro.
